alt="image-20230221155539238"
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;開始升級
&lt;img src="https://kenkenny.synology.me:5543/images/2023/09/Mine_Veeam13.png"
loading="lazy"
alt="image-20230221155645278"
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://kenkenny.synology.me:5543/images/2023/09/Mine_Veeam14.png"
